OL,3,GNEWSATfL to tackle hate crime through
OL,4,AVR experiences
OL,5,
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) is hosting
OL,7,Fvirtual reality demonstrations at some
OL,8,Fof London's stations to show passengers
OL,9,Fwhat it is like to witness a hate crime
OL,10,Fand how to respond safely.
OL,12,FThe demonstrations will take place at
OL,13,FStratford, Liverpool Street,
OL,14,FHarrow-on-the-Hill, Victoria, Euston,
OL,15,FGolders Green, Stamford Hill and
OL,16,FFinsbury Park.
OL,18,FThe immersive experience puts people in
OL,19,Fthe shoes of a bystander witnessing a
OL,20,Fhate crime and shows ways they can
OL,21,Fsafely step in and support the person
OL,22,Fbeing targeted.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
